 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"contact-fields:full\"]: \"Create, read, update and delete person and organization fields\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"contacts:full\"]: \"Create, read, update and delete persons and organizations and their followers; all notes, files, filters. Also grants read access to contacts-related fields\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"contacts:read\"]: \"Read the data about persons and organizations, their related fields and followers; also all notes, files, filters\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"deal-fields:full\"]: \"Create, read, update and delete deal fields\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"deals:full\"]: \"Create, read, update and delete deals, its participants and followers; all files, notes, and filters. It also includes read access to deal fields, pipelines, stages, and statistics. Does not include access to activities (except the last and next activity related to a deal)\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"deals:read\"]: \"Read most of the data about deals and related entities - deal fields, products, followers, participants; all notes, files, filters, pipelines, stages, and statistics. Does not include access to activities (except the last and next activity related to a deal)\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"goals:full\"]: \"Create, read, update and delete goals\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"goals:read\"]: \"Read data on all goals\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"leads:full\"]: \"Create, read, update and delete leads and lead labels\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"leads:read\"]: \"Read data about leads and lead labels\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"mail:full\"]: \"Read, update and delete mail threads. Also grants read access to mail messages\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"mail:read\"]: \"Read mail threads and messages\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"product-fields:full\"]: \"Create, read, update and delete product fields\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"products:full\"]: \"Create, read, update and delete products and its fields; add products to deals\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"products:read\"]: \"Read products, its fields, files, followers and products connected to a deal\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"projects:full\"]: \"Create, read, update and delete projects and its fields; add projects templates and project related tasks\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"projects:read\"]: \"Read projects and its fields, tasks and project templates\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"recents:read\"]: \"Read all recent changes occurred in an account. Includes data about activities, activity types, deals, files, filters, notes, persons, organizations, pipelines, stages, products and users\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"search:read\"]: \"Search across the account for deals, persons, organizations, files and products, and see details about the returned results\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.[\"users:read\"]: \"Read data about users (people with access to a Pipedrive account), their permissions, roles and followers\"",
 "schemes.oauth2.flows.authorizationCode.scopes.admin: \"Allows to do many things that an administrator can do in a Pipedrive company account - create, read, update and delete pipelines and its stages; deal, person and organization fields; activity types; users and permissions, etc. It also allows the app to create webhooks and fetch and delete webhooks that are created by the app\"",
